- Buyers may not access another buyer's inquiry records.
- Inquiry decisions must not become purchase or reservation transactions.

### Profiles and role assignment

Preserve secure profile role assignment.

Do not permit users to elevate their own permissions through browser state, local storage, or unrestricted profile updates.

## Migration safety

